WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.230
Satoshi, who aims to battle
the Supreme Monarch, Dande...

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:10.240
And Go, who dreams of catching every Pokémon
to work his way up to Mew...

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:15.530
This is the story of
their lives and adventures.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:22.360
If I’m hiking up mountains...

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:25.750
I might have to cross a river...

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.710
What’re you up to, Go?

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:32.250
Oh, just choosing which Pokémon
to take for the race.

00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.180
I thought I’d enter this!

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:37.180
The Pokémon Catching
Adventure Race?

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:42.400
It’s a race where you catch Pokémon
while hiking up a mountain to reach the goal!

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:44.760
That’s a perfect race for you!

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:45.940
Huh?

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.450
The race is in Alola?

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:48.950
Yeah!

00:00:49.330 --> 00:00:52.240
It’s a chance to catch
some more Alolan Pokémon!

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:53.280
I can’t wait!

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:57.030
It’s a team race.
Let’s do it together, Satoshi!

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:58.690
Okay.

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:00.680
Let’s go for it, Pikachu!

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.250
Alola Region

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:41.890
Satoshi and Go have arrived
on a deserted island in Alola...
Alola Region

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:45.140
Satoshi and Go have arrived
on a deserted island in Alola...

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:48.060
...to enter the Pokémon Catching
Adventure Race.

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.520
Entry complete!

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.150
I can’t wait!

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:04.950
You’re Mr. Satoshi, the Alola Pokémon League’s
first Champion, aren’t you?!

00:03:06.460 --> 00:03:08.260
I can’t believe we found you here!

00:03:08.260 --> 00:03:10.750
Can I shake your hand?!

00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:12.340
Let us snap some pics with you!

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:15.140
Oh, this is giving me <i>all</i> the feels!

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:17.470
The Alola League Champion?

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:19.970
I competed in a tournament here.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:21.720
And I ended up winning.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.090
What?!

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.960
That’s amazing, Satoshi!

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:26.600
Why did you never mention that?!

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.850
Oh, I didn’t?

00:03:28.850 --> 00:03:31.120
Mr. Satoshi,
you’re entering the race too?!

00:03:31.120 --> 00:03:32.730
Yeah, with Go.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:33.560
Nice to meet you.

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.860
Good to meetcha, too!

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.780
We’re the Full Power Brothers team,
and I’m Zen!

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:38.720
I’m Ryoku!

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:43.210
We’re gonna beat Champion Satoshi
and take the win with some real full power!

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:45.030
‘Cause after all...

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.700
...we’re always...

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.950
...goin’ at full power!

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:52.220
Let’s all give it all we got!

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:53.510
See ya!

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:58.560
They’re really stoked!

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:00.170
Y-Yeah...

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:05.010
Now, it’s time to start...
the Pokémon Catching Adventure Race!

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:13.520
What can we expect from a race
on a deserted Alolan island brimming with nature?!

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:16.150
Check out the monitor!

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.750
Here’s the course for today’s race!

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:23.160
Once they’re off, the teams
will pass through checkpoints and head for the goal!

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:26.220
If they don’t accomplish
the Pokémon-catching tasks along their way,

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:29.400
they can’t pass the checkpoints!

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:31.540
Today’s race is a team race!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:36.920
Pairs of trainers are gonna work together with
their Pokémon to make it to the goal!

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:41.670
Each trainer can only bring
three Pokémon with them!

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:44.400
Flying on your Pokémon is not allowed,

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:48.640
but you can ride them,
swim on them, and use their moves!

00:04:48.640 --> 00:04:54.060
The winners will receive a trophy
and a year’s supply of Malasada Doughnuts, an Alolan delicacy!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:05:00.930
There’s bound to be lots of mountain hiking
on a deserted island race, so it’ll be pretty tough!

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:03.400
We better give it
everything we’ve got, together!

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:07.570
Teams, are you ready?

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:16.900
On your marks...

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:18.480
Start!

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:19.890
Let’s go!

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:20.710
Yeah!

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:34.100
That must be
the first checkpoint, up there!

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:37.300
Hold on, Sarunori!

00:05:43.690 --> 00:05:45.820
That’s a pretty dangerous path...

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.490
Well, in that case...

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:50.000
Gantle, go!

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.380
I get it, Gantle!

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:56.700
Gantle, let us ride on your back!

00:05:58.020 --> 00:06:00.470
Head for the top of that cliff!

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:02.000
Yeah!

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.220
Good work, Gantle!

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:11.370
The race has begun.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.420
You remember the plan?

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:17.500
We’ll ambush them during the race
and take Pikachu, meow.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:22.590
And we can snatch
all the Alolan Pokémon they catch, too!

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:24.190
Alola, huh...?

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:25.060
What now?

00:06:25.060 --> 00:06:27.790
I wonder how Hidoide’s doing.

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:30.570
There’s Mimikyu too, meow.

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:34.830
After the operation...
How about we go and check in on them?

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.410
Sounds good.

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:40.210
With that settled,
hurry up over here, brat boy!

00:06:40.210 --> 00:06:44.270
They have to complete the task
in order to pass the checkpoint!

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:47.720
The teams will receive the tasks
on their smartphones!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:50.220
Here it is!

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:56.160
Task 1:
Catch an Alolan Ishitsubute.

00:06:57.260 --> 00:07:02.360
Ishitsubute! Alolan form! Rock Pokémon!
Rock/Electric type!

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:05.540
Commonly found near
mountain trails and the like!

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:07.310
If they’re found on
mountain trails...

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:09.530
They should be right here!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:28.200
There’s one!

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:30.150
Monster Ball, go!

00:07:38.910 --> 00:07:43.310
Ishitsubute: Alolan Form’s data
will be added to the Index!

00:07:43.310 --> 00:07:45.420
A successful catch!

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:46.820
Go, hurry up!

00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:54.030
We’re goin’ on ahead!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:56.790
After them, Gantle!

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.270
Where is it?

00:07:58.270 --> 00:07:59.250
Any luck?

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:02.750
The Full Power Brothers team
is currently leading the pack!

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:06.210
But Go and Satoshi’s team
is closing the distance behind them!

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:17.070
No good,
it ain’t gonna budge...

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:21.680
No sweat! We got a secret plan
for times like these!

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:23.940
Let’s go! Z-Move time!

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:28.690
What’s this? A Z-Move?!

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.610
The Full Power Brothers
are about to perform a Z-Move!

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:34.990
Watch this!

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:37.240
Here’s some real power!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:40.640
Awesome! Intense!
Jaw-dropping!

00:08:42.370 --> 00:08:44.380
Full Power Brothers!

00:08:44.380 --> 00:08:46.200
At max power!

00:08:46.200 --> 00:08:51.580
Go! Blazing Soulbeat!

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:05.850
Use Headbutt, Gantle!

00:09:09.310 --> 00:09:10.320
You did it!

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.690
They should be
almost here, meow.

00:09:26.150 --> 00:09:27.360
Everything okay?

00:09:28.140 --> 00:09:29.900
You saved us...

00:09:29.900 --> 00:09:30.410
But!

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:32.210
The real battle starts now!

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:44.440
You can use Z-Moves too,
right, Satoshi?

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:45.600
Yeah!

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.940
But not today,
‘cause I left my Z-Ring behind.

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:50.320
Wha...?

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:55.320
Five teams have managed to catch an Ishitsubute
and pass the checkpoint!

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:59.570
The next checkpoint
is on the other side of this lake!

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:05.450
It’s a new task!

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:09.110
Task 2:
Catch a Hagigishiri.

00:10:09.110 --> 00:10:10.710
Hagigishiri, huh?

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:16.110
Hagigishiri! Gnash Teeth Pokémon!
Water/Psychic type!

00:10:16.110 --> 00:10:19.530
When it unleashes its psychic power
from the protuberance on its head,

00:10:19.530 --> 00:10:23.100
the grating sound of grinding teeth
echoes through the area!

00:10:23.770 --> 00:10:25.350
Are they in this lake?

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:27.380
Hmm... I can’t tell...

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:29.220
I know!

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:31.190
Lucario, I choose you!

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:38.570
Lucario, use your Aura to see if
there’s any Hagigishiri in the lake!

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:39.410
These guys!

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:04.370
Pocket Monsters!

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:17.880
It was over there somewhere!

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:20.270
Come on out, Namakobushi!

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:24.830
Battle Hagigishiri
so I can catch it!

00:11:31.750 --> 00:11:33.580
Pikachu! Electroweb!

00:11:40.420 --> 00:11:42.130
Namakobushi! Toxic!

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:52.140
Monster Ball, go!

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:04.660
Hagigishiri’s data will be
added to the Index!

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:06.360
All right, I caught it!

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:08.180
You ain’t bad!

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:10.790
That’s the Champion’s team for sure!

00:12:11.450 --> 00:12:12.810
How’re you doing?

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:14.660
Did you find a Hagigishiri?

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:17.120
Nah, we’re lookin’ for it now!

00:12:18.500 --> 00:12:20.730
There it is!

00:12:20.730 --> 00:12:22.340
We’re gonna do it this time!

00:12:27.770 --> 00:12:28.970
Watch this!

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:30.600
Here’s some real power!

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:33.520
Awesome! Intense!
Jaw-dropping!

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:37.960
Full Power Brothers!

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:39.720
At max power!

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:45.240
Go! Blazing Soulbeat!

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:54.210
It got away!

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:59.740
Even with our Z-Move,
it got away...

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.590
That wasn’t a Z-Move.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:07.410
What do you mean?
Didn’t you see my Z-Ring?

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:12.220
Wearing a Z-Ring doesn’t mean
you can pull off Z-Moves anytime.

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:14.730
This is so embarrassing!

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:18.410
We messed up in front of our hero,
the Alolan Champion!

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:23.240
We thought we’d mastered Z-Moves,
just like the Champion!

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:26.890
Your hearts aren’t in sync
with Jararanga, though.

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:28.190
Our hearts, huh?

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:32.140
You know, how your heart heats up
and goes all <i>vraaaaah</i> sometimes!

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:35.250
Times like when you just can’t lose,
or you go, like, “I’ll take you on!”

00:13:35.250 --> 00:13:37.010
Yeah, yeah!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:38.890
In those “Now!” moments...

00:13:38.890 --> 00:13:43.390
If your hearts sync up with a <i>ba-ba-ba-bang</i>,
that’s when you can use Z-Moves!

00:13:43.390 --> 00:13:46.630
<i>“Ba-ba-ba-bang”</i>...?
They won’t understand that.

00:13:46.630 --> 00:13:48.890
Nah, we get it loud and clear!

00:13:48.890 --> 00:13:51.520
Big ups for the advice!

00:13:51.520 --> 00:13:52.450
Sure.

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:55.890
But that doesn’t change our battle!

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:56.390
Huh?

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:58.350
We’re gonna catch a Hagigishiri...

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.650
...and catch up real quick!

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:05.650
We should hurry, too!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:06.740
Yeah.

00:14:06.740 --> 00:14:11.170
Only four teams managed to
catch a Hagigishiri and pass the checkpoint!

00:14:11.170 --> 00:14:14.240
The race is approaching
its climax!

00:14:19.370 --> 00:14:23.590
We waited to ambush them,
but nobody came...

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.670
We guessed
the wrong spot, meow...

00:14:27.000 --> 00:14:30.510
Well then...
We’re just gonna have to charge in on ‘em!

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:36.960
The final task is...
Catch a Nagetsukesaru!

00:14:37.550 --> 00:14:41.340
Nagetsukesaru! Teamwork Pokémon!
Fighting type!

00:14:41.340 --> 00:14:44.580
Displaying amazing teamwork,
they follow the orders of their boss,

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:48.640
as they all help out in the search
for their favorite berries!

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:54.030
Thanks, Pikachu!

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:56.120
What’re you doing with that?

00:14:56.120 --> 00:14:59.690
Nagetsukesaru love to play catch.

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:00.800
So...

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:07.470
Here they come!

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:12.470
All right... Sarunori!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:35.830
Good work,
Sarunori and Pikachu!

00:15:46.660 --> 00:15:48.210
We caught ‘em, meow!

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:49.840
Team Rocket!

00:15:51.820 --> 00:15:56.190
We’ll be taking
all the Pokémon here!

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:58.310
Vending, come on!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:03.850
Rocket...

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:05.060
Vending...

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:06.860
Secret!

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.280
What’re we gonna get?!

00:16:11.620 --> 00:16:14.360
The Fruits Pokémon, Tropius!

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:17.160
The Flower Pokémon, Rafflesia!

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:19.160
Rafflesia! Sleep Powder!

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:31.720
All right!
It doesn’t affect Sarunori!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.720
Tropius, take care of it!

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:50.500
Sarunori!
How can you just start eating?!

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:55.950
What’s wrong, Champion?!

00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:58.710
Who’re those guys?!

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:02.500
They’re Team Rocket! Bad guys who try to
steal other people’s Pokémon!

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:06.040
We’re off!

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:13.550
Byesy-meow, meowsy-bye!

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:18.010
You’re not getting away!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:19.950
Champion!

00:17:19.950 --> 00:17:21.190
Hold on!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:23.770
You can leave this to us!

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:29.020
Right now, we’re really <i>vraaaaah</i>ing
to beat the bad guys!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.030
Got it. Go for it!

00:17:33.390 --> 00:17:34.280
‘Kay!

00:17:34.280 --> 00:17:35.900
Come on, Jararanga!

00:17:40.580 --> 00:17:41.800
Watch this!

00:17:41.800 --> 00:17:43.720
Here’s some real power!

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:47.100
Awesome! Intense!
Jaw-dropping!

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:56.830
Full Power Brothers!

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.720
At max power!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:04.430
Go! Blazing Soulbeat!

00:18:09.310 --> 00:18:12.020
Wha-Wha-What the...?!

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:24.080
<i>What an awful feeling!</i>

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:26.650
Yeah!

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:36.940
The Full Power Brothers team
used their Z-Move to stop the interference in the race!

00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:40.090
They rescued their rival team
from a real tight spot!

00:18:43.940 --> 00:18:45.420
You nailed that Z-Move!

00:18:45.420 --> 00:18:46.600
That was awesome!

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:49.040
All right!

00:18:49.040 --> 00:18:51.880
The Champion praised us!

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:56.230
But!

00:18:56.230 --> 00:18:58.740
That doesn’t change our battle!

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:00.130
Yeah, I know!

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:02.500
We’ll give it our full power till the end!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:12.590
The race for first place is down to
Go and Satoshi’s team versus the Full Power Brothers team!

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:17.010
Which team will come out on top?!

00:19:24.550 --> 00:19:27.310
The Pokémon Catching Adventure Race!

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:30.200
The winners are Go and Satoshi’s team!

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:32.050
Congratulations!

00:19:32.050 --> 00:19:33.190
Thank you!

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:35.190
We did it!

00:19:38.820 --> 00:19:41.620
And today,
we have another team on stage!

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:44.660
For protecting the race with their full power,
and entertaining us until the very end,

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:52.540
the Full Power Brothers team will receive a year’s supply of Malasada Doughnuts as a full-powered Special Prize!

00:19:53.980 --> 00:19:55.270
Big ups!

00:19:55.270 --> 00:19:57.300
We’ll down ‘em with our full power!

00:20:06.850 --> 00:20:08.630
What, meow?

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.460
Oh, I haven’t seen you in forever!

00:20:24.460 --> 00:20:26.430
They look well, meow!

00:20:38.970 --> 00:20:41.880
What even <i>is</i> this feeling?

00:20:43.010 --> 00:20:44.590
Mr. Satoshi!

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:46.740
Mr. Go!

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:48.540
Hey. Thanks for everything.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:50.890
Thanks for helping us out today.

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:55.160
Huge ups for the Z-Move advice, too!

00:20:55.160 --> 00:21:00.650
We’re gonna full-power train our Z-Move
so someday we can battle the Champion!

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.690
And next time, we won’t lose!

00:21:02.690 --> 00:21:04.780
Sure, I can’t wait!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:05.920
Go for it!

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:20.500
A Hyper Class official battle
has been scheduled for one week from now.

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:25.460
Huh. In the Hyper Class,
you get notifications beforehand.

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:28.700
Your opponent is Contestant Denji,
ranked 27th.

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:33.680
Denji...? <i>That</i> Denji?

00:21:34.410 --> 00:21:39.360
Satoshi is set to battle
the Sinnoh Gym Leader, Denji.

00:21:39.890 --> 00:21:43.600
His battles upon a new stage
are about to commence.

00:23:07.230 --> 00:23:09.670
Now! Onto the next adventure!

00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:10.860
Go!

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:14.190
Let’s go! A Hyper Class battle!

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:17.080
You’re facing Sinnoh’s
strongest Gym Leader, Denji!

00:23:17.080 --> 00:23:19.750
Satoshi,
you’ve battled him before, yeah?

00:23:19.750 --> 00:23:20.370
Yeah!

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:23.490
I can’t wait to see what Pokémon
he’ll use this time!

00:23:23.490 --> 00:23:26.760
You better win!
I’ll be going all out cheering for you!

00:23:26.760 --> 00:23:27.310
‘Course!

00:23:27.310 --> 00:23:28.760
Let’s do this, Pikachu!

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:31.530
Next time, on Pocket Monsters:

00:23:31.530 --> 00:23:34.320
A Super Electromagnetic Hyper Class Battle!
